100 REM A USER HANDLER THAT HANDLES 3101 RAISED BY MAT PRINT ENDS THE STATEMENT: NOTHING OF THE ARRAY IS PRINTED
105 REM (4.1 L.1360-1368, 5.2.6)
110 DIM M(2)
120 WHEN EXCEPTION IN
130   PRINT "X";
